- 16 new `MetadataService` unit tests (save, delete, field merge, diff detection)
- 2 new `ObjectManagerPage` API integration tests
- 19 FieldDesigner tests updated for modal-based create/edit/cancel flows
- Full console suite passes (59 files, 788 tests)
